# Kernel-Certified Depth-2 Recursive IVC Root Proof, Two-Child Stitch & Tamper Refutations

Certifies concrete kernel acceptance (`verifyConcreteIvcRoot`, `parentStitchCheck`) of a depth-2
root proof `rootPi` (`[0, 4)`) together with its two depth-1 child proofs `leftPi` (`[0, 2)`) and
`rightPi` (`[2, 4)`), parent matrix-claim fold `rootFold`, and three tamper rejections (`fast_root_flip`,
`fast_ood_flip`, `fast_child_boundary_flip`).
